Gateway stays online
Incoming message arrives
Gateway emits event to control plane
Control plane wakes heavy agent worker
Worker decides response
Gateway sends response
Worker sleeps
Gateway remains online

Pros:

* strong user experience
* much cheaper than full always-on AI worker
