Problem:

If two gateway processes use the same channel session, bad things happen:

* duplicate replies
* broken Telegram/WhatsApp session
* provider security checks
* race conditions
* corrupted local state
* user loses trust

Need two locks:

A. Local process lock

Already exists in empyralis-gateway/src/index.ts using gateway.lock.

This prevents two local gateway processes from using the same state dir.

