Stage 11: Recovery Behavior

Graceful Gateway Shutdown

Flow:

Gateway receives SIGTERM.
Gateway stops accepting new work.
Gateway checkpoints state.
Gateway sends gateway.disconnect if socket active.
Gateway stops personal runtimes.
Gateway releases process lock.
Control plane marks offline/stopped.

