test_gateway_sigterm_flushes_state_before_exit

Gateway Crash

Flow:

Heartbeat stops.
Control plane marks stale after timeout.
Lease expires after grace period.
Dashboard shows reconnecting/offline.
Restarted service loads local state.
Gateway reconnects and resumes.

Test:

test_gateway_crash_then_restart_recovers_session
test_gateway_crash_marks_channel_connected_gateway_offline

VPS Reboot

Flow:

