Stage 19: What To Do About 1GB RAM VPS

Use 1GB VPS only for lightweight gateway and simple connectors.

Good for:

Telegram gateway
small Node gateway
websocket heartbeat
message relay
queue polling
basic shell/files server mode
small supervisor

Bad for:

Chrome/Playwright
multiple browser sessions
WhatsApp + heavy runtime
local LLMs
large vector DB
many users
desktop-like computer use

Recommended sizes:

1GB RAM:
  Telegram-only lightweight gateway for one low-volume user.
2GB RAM:
  Better minimum hosted Agent Computer MVP.
4GB RAM:
  Browser, WhatsApp, mixed personal channels, more stable.
8GB+ RAM:
  dedicated business/customer-support gateway with browser/computer-use.

Do not put many users’ personal channels into one messy shared VPS without strict container isolation.

Correct multi-user model:

one container per workspace/gateway
separate volume per gateway
separate gateway_id
separate channel leases
separate secrets
no shared browser profile
no shared Telegram/WhatsApp session dir

